 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・Walters（品種）: 咲き終わった花を取ると花期が延び、二番花が咲く。冬に地際で刈る。機械は空欄",
  "management_type_quote": "Remove faded flowers to encourage a second bloom.",
  "management_type_by_matching": null,
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/同じ種の別品種（F05・F08）] 耐暑性；強（この品種のページはない。信頼度：低）\n[MBG/品種] Needs good air circulation (space well and thin out stems as needed) to help combat potential powdery mildew problems.\n[NC State/種] Good air circulation (adequate spacing and thinning of stems as needed) will help combat powdery mildew.\n[Walters/品種] Good mildew resistance although all Summer Phlox benefit from a location that provides good air circulation and consistent moisture.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 欧米の文献だけの耐暑性：言い回しの照合では 空欄、文を読み直して 中（[MBG・品種] prefers climates with mild summers compared to very hot and humid conditions）\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の同じ種の品種の値を採った",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] Removing faded flower panicles will ... prevent self-seeding（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] Removing faded flower panicles will prolong blooming and prevent self-seeding as cultivars do not come true from seed.\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：空欄）",
  "mixing_evidence": "[読み直し 2026-11-24] 株立ちの記述だけで、広がる記述がない：[NC State・種] clump-forming",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[MBG・品種] This is an upright perennial that grows in a clump to 2-4' tall and to 2-3' wide on stiff stems clad with conspicuously veined, opposite, pointed, elliptic, deep green leaves (to 4-6\" long).",
  "sources_with_cultivar_page": "MBG、Walters",
